m into a bunny, what, according to her, saves her energy. This is not surprising considering that she always travels sitting on the Prir's hands. While in human form, she has great physical strength. And when her life is threatened, she goes berserk and can single-handedly beat even a dragon. Loco terribly loves the tea and sweets. She is the life and soul of the company, and thanks to her tea party sessions, our heroes can easily forget all the disputes and enjoy the peaceful atmosphere. However, she often says what she thinks, which is why she often becomes a punching bag for some enraged characters. Locomoco had her own reasons to join Caro's group, which she, of course, won't tell anyone."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c10598"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e4/e4fae9f91b2593b385af00719c10721dae2c0a5ac194d233db772ba9fa74efcf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/7921d7b8c62b2c1734ff685b5961ad7627a23315c56b7f1b8a284d8391140934.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ひなき 藍","creatorId":"vndb:s564","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s564","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s564","name":"ミルノ 純","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45111","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12623","characterName":"カロ・プロロフルト","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12623"},"originalCharacterName":"カロ・プロロフルト","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Caro is the leader of the group of girls involved in the conflict, the scale of which they are not even aware. As a good leader, Caro tries to rally his team and protect these strong, but at the same time, fragile girls. His brave and pure heart, a sturdy sword, and dreams of a bright future, will certainly help them to overcome all the hardships and bring peace to the earth."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12623"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aa2f1eb8b52ba82f22b4d4837fef5392c9771cdc7663d71a3b21e01be8236b00.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b3/b30d09ef275684f2711287210777c1306d69c2ec57cf9ceb6d76f772406cff91.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"加賀 ヒカル","creatorId":"vndb:s1058","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1058","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1058","name":"平田 宏美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45113","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12624","characterName":"エウレッタ・ゼーユングフラウ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12624"},"originalCharacterName":"エウレッタ・ゼーユングフラウ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A priestess with extensive powers who carries out special duties of the religious community named Ordinis. Euretta's reasons for joining a group of heroes are as mysterious as her own personality. She persistently avoids any friendly relationships with Caro and others. She keeps a low profile and hardly talks. But once she secludes herself, she uncovers the hidden features of her character. She's kind to children and loves the nature. Euretta's magical abilities are always helps to treat the wounded warriors and eliminate the evil creatures. So, why is she avoids people? What else terrible secrets she's hiding?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12624"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/2057004f01afc21681edc667f7aebc96779ca4056ecb7ad5b4cdf95939b8435f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/26/26e1963b5d7340954d68249a1ec303eb476b13995757c4460c33886286cf6067.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中川 彩子","creatorId":"vndb:s81","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s81","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s81","name":"浅川 悠","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45114","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12625","characterName":"リューリカ・メルン","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12625"},"originalCharacterName":"リューリカ・メルン","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Lyrica is an adult woman with magnificent breasts who loves to drink alcohol at the bar and teasing men, especially Caro. She became a participant of this dangerous adventure, hoping to meet more demons. Something terrible happened In the Lyrica's past, that made her hate the demons. Since that time, she fanatically hunts them, unable to quench her thirst for revenge. For this purpose she uses the power of a controlled spirit, and to strengthen it, Lyrica sucks the blood of defeated demons through her dagger. But what awaits her on the path of revenge? If there is someone who would help her to abandon this course?"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12625"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/21029ce4bb4dce77fe9597bcf6fa2cd6b0b16eb75e12dd8dd199179085e0d432.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/389362b686b772ab1a371ebe8de44d14a8747f1068847443d6d81b0b573321fe.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"はるか めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s3635","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s3635","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s3635","name":"宮川 美保","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45119","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12626","characterName":"アルシェ・フィドル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12626"},"originalCharacterName":"アルシェ・フィドル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Arcie resembles the girl from high society, but she hides her origin for some reason, and even stammers while trying to tell her own name. As if lost, she gave the impression of a person who knows almost nothing about the life of ordinary people. Naivety of Arcie could cost her her life, if Caro wouldn't saved her from the street criminals. He kindly agreed to show her various interesting places in the celebrating town. Thus begins their joint odyssey in which Arcie will show her courage, will protect the justice, and will share her sincere heat with the people around."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12626"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/5256f1d7dda4c54b606e496b548d2c5468b050f49b09affb63cd18bccdd90beb.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/70642e39a0607811e5b4e45839ff14c86fa29ff26f8ea5fc65595f1c3f6fd54c.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"立花 あや","creatorId":"vndb:s62","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s62","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s62","name":"南條 愛乃","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:45110","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12627","characterName":"ファルテ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12627"},"originalCharacterName":"ファルテ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"appears","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Faltefierte is an elf girl who lived in the woods, scaring the intruders and waiting for return of her brother, who disappeared many years ago. For some unknown reason, the elven race did not participate in a large-scale war for survival against the demons that took place a century ago. Moreover, the elves had completely disappeared. And every person who saw Falte, wasn't only surprised to meet her, but also didn't missed a chance to accuse her and all the elven race of cowardice. Although Falte painfully experienced such treatment, it didn't stop her to bravely challenge the powerful forces of evil and overcome many difficult trials. But despite her great age, she looks and acts like a clumsy and sulky child. In addition, she is constantly in fight with Lyrica, arguing about the age and size of the breast."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12627"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a47baee905b111ac37543cc09ddcfe07b72c092eef0b086c063fcb140d8330e.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/aa/aab4528217e52fb984823485d3d2995b5ad0c2dbbaca7570de3eeaeb18d9f7e9.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"きのみ 聖","creatorId":"vndb:s569","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s569","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s569","name":"春夏 ひとみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":